 PARITY — web source -> native (features/dashboard/widgets/ChargeStatusWidget.tsx)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Data sources : useVehicles, useVehicleState(id), useUnits, useTranslation('dashboard')
                 -> bound through ChargeStatusSource (P1/S8). NO HTTP in the view.
  Branches reproduced (all three from the web source):
    1. state.is_charging -> Charging: a 2x2 grid of Power / Rate / Battery / Time to Full
       + a pulsing bolt + "Charging" header (emerald / Color.TS.statusSuccess; pulse respects
       Reduce Motion via .symbolEffect(.pulse, isActive: !reduceMotion)).
    2. state (not charging) -> "Not Charging" + "{battery}% · {rated_range} {unit}".
    3. no state -> ContentUnavailableView "No charge data" (web <EmptyState/>).
  Numeric pipeline (ported 1:1 from lib/numberFormat.ts + lib/unitConversion.ts):
    - Power      : kW as-is, fmtNumber(charger_power)            -> global precision (default 2), grouped.
    - Rate       : SI m/h, fmtInt(convertDistanceFromSI(charge_rate ?? 0, unit)) -> 0 dp, grouped, "{unit}/h".
                   convertDistanceFromSI(m, unit) = m / metersPerUnit (km 1000 · mi 1609.344 · ft 0.3048).
    - Battery    : raw JS `${battery_level}` coercion -> locale-invariant, UNGROUPED ("1234" not "1,234").
    - Time to Full: time>0 ? fmtNumber(time,1)+"h" : "—".
    - Rated range: SI m, fmtNumber(convertDistanceFromSI(rated_range ?? 0, unit), 0).
  i18n keys from source : widget.charging, widget.power, widget.rate, widget.battery,
                 widget.timeToFull, widget.notCharging, widget.noChargeData, widget.chargeStatus
                 (+ .description) — ALL present in the strings table; no English literal in the Swift
                 code (everything via ChargeStatusStrings).
  Registry (registry/charging.ts -> "charge-status") :
                 id=charge-status · category=charging · default 2x2 · min 1x2 · max 3x40
                 — pinned by ChargeStatusRegistryTests (executed below).
  States (all render, none hidden) : loading (skeleton grid) · empty · error (retry) · content
                 (charging | idle), plus freshness chip live/updating/stale/offline + stale
                 auto-refresh + offline/stale connectivity banner.
  Telemetry    : view.opened with surface slug "ChargeStatusWidget" (P1/S11) — asserted.
  Accessibility: VoiceOver labels on every cell + combined summaries; Dynamic Type (minimumScaleFactor);
                 Reduce Motion gates the charging-bolt pulse.

